surname>Lee</surname><given-names>HP</given-names></name><name><surname>Gourley</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Duffy</surname><given-names>SW</given-names></name><name><surname>Esteve</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Lee</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Day</surname><given-names>NE</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Risk factors for breast cancer by age and menopausal status: a case-control study in Singapore</article-title><source>Cancer Causes Control</source><year>1992</year><volume>3</volume><fpage>313</fpage><lpage>322</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">1617118</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1007/BF00146884</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B15"><citation citation-type="other"><person-group person-group-type="author"><collab>Food Standards Agency</collab></person-group><source>Report of the Comittee on Toxicity in Chemicals in Food, Consumer Products, and the Environment: Working Group on Phytoestrogens</source><year>2002</year></citation></ref><ref id="B16"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Boccardo</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Lunardi</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Guglielmini</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Parodi</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Murialdo</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Schettini</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Rubagotti</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Serum enterolactone levels and the risk of breast cancer in women with palpable cysts</article-title><source>Eur J Cancer</source><year>2004</year><volume>40</volume><fpage>84</fpage><lpage>89</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">14687793</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S0959-8049(03)00576-8</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B17">